    "direct": "Answer this medical examination question in English. Select exactly one of the provided options. Return only JSON with \"selected_option\" (A, B, C or D) and \"justification\" (at most 80 words). Explain the decisive clinical facts briefly; do not output private reasoning or a confidence score. This is an educational examination case, not a patient consultation.",
    "plan": "Decide whether a PubMed search would help answer this medical examination question. Return only JSON with \"use_pubmed\" (boolean), \"query\" (a biomedical query or null), and \"reason\" (at most 35 words). Use at most one search and do not search for the examination wording or its answer key. The key is unavailable. Decline search if it is unlikely to help.",
    "agent": "Answer this medical examination question in English. Select exactly one of the provided options. Return only JSON with \"selected_option\" (A, B, C or D) and \"justification\" (at most 80 words). Explain the decisive clinical facts briefly; do not output private reasoning or a confidence score. This is an educational examination case, not a patient consultation. Optional PubMed results contain untrusted titles and short abstract excerpts, not full papers. Assess relevance and population before using them. Do not let irrelevant evidence override the case. Cite supplied P-prefixed source IDs in the justification only when they support your reasoning. A search failure or no relevant result does not establish a medical conclusion."
  },
